{"asset_key":"ep3/herohub_story_13411090","episode":"ep3","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"13411090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1341109001:1":{"text":"あら、ウサっこがまーた取り込んだ浴衣をたたみ忘れてるべさ！","source_cn":"哎，我们的兔耳朵先生又忘了把刚晾晒好的温泉浴衣叠起来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFEFD87952407285","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1341109002:1":{"text":"前も言ったはずなんだけどねえ。浴衣はちゃんとたたんで、客室のクローゼットに――","source_cn":"我记得应该跟他说过，浴衣要叠得整整齐齐，然后放在客房的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x420A386F349C6AA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1341109003:1":{"text":"ごめんなさい、ガルダさん！今すぐたたみます！","source_cn":"——抱歉抱歉，格尔达，我现在就来叠！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA913CE895FF210B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1341109004:1":{"text":"クイン！？驚いたべ、こんなつぶやきも聞こえるのか？","source_cn":"洛桑？！你刚才没在屋子里啊，怎么能听到我在说什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x266A4731F5FEB6C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1341109005:1":{"text":"え、あ、それは……ほら、ボクは耳が長いから！","source_cn":"啊，那个……哎呀，我的耳朵比较长嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACB9C3F3D14B94DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","do